abstract: >-
  An evidence-focused release documenting simulated domestic navigation,
  human-priority yielding, multisensor continuity, active resident search,
  bidirectional person-following and reacquisition experiments conducted
  with ROS 2, Nav2 and Gazebo.
keywords:
  - ROS 2
  - Nav2
  - Gazebo
  - assistive robotics
  - person following
